sequenceDiagram
  participant A as Administrator
  participant P as PAM / JIT
  participant C as Change Control
  participant S as Target System
  participant E as Audit Evidence Plane
  A->>P: Request time-bound access
  P->>C: Verify ticket and approvals
  C-->>P: Approved scope and expiry
  P->>S: Brokered recorded session
  S-->>P: Operation result
  P->>E: Canonical evidence receipt
  E-->>C: Immutable verification reference

